+// Mirror's Edge Android port: per-frame cache of texture/sampler descriptor sets and
+// UpdateBindings counters. Upstream rewrites both texture descriptor sets on every draw
+// ("TODO(Triang3l): Reuse texture and sampler bindings if not changed"), which costs
